     "replacement": "_If_ the graph of $h(t)$ were linear, the magnitude of its gradient would give the hive’s speed.\n\nBut $h(t)$ is non-linear because the hive accelerates. The magnitude of the gradient of the line joining the endpoints gives only the average speed (for now).",
